      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Responsiveness and mobile devices\"\n",
        "author: \"Charlotte Hadley\"\n",
        "date: \"2025-08-27\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "[Bootstrap's grid layout system](https://quarto.org/docs/output-formats/page-layout.html#css-grid) provides true flexibility. It can get quite complicated.\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.grid}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.g-col-6 .g-col-md-4}"
      ],
      "id": "1a5e77b7"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "from ipyleaflet import Map, Marker, basemaps, basemap_to_tiles\n",
        "m = Map(\n",
        "  basemap=basemap_to_tiles(\n",
        "    basemaps.NASAGIBS.ModisTerraTrueColorCR, \"2017-04-08\"\n",
        "  ),\n",
        "  center=(51.476852, -0.000500),\n",
        "  zoom=4\n",
        ")\n",
        "m.add_layer(Marker(location=(51.476852, -0.000500)))\n",
        "m"
      ],
      "id": "75086c50",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
